WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.118 --> 00:00:22.548
"Wow!" Ben's eyes went wide as he floated into the gym.

2
00:00:22.549 --> 00:00:30.268
Tomorrow was the first day of the Monster Academy pet show, and several monsters were already setting up exhibits.

3
00:00:30.269 --> 00:00:35.285
He went over to look at a fish tank.

4
00:00:35.286 --> 00:00:39.111
"Is that a flying shark?" he asked a fish monster.

5
00:00:39.112 --> 00:00:42.203
A tiny shark leaped out of the tank and snapped at him.

6
00:00:42.204 --> 00:00:45.698
"Yikes!" Ben jumped back.

7
00:00:45.699 --> 00:00:49.403
"Stay away from that display!" the fish monster snapped.

8
00:00:49.404 --> 00:00:52.413
"The show doesn't officially start until tomorrow.

9
00:00:52.414 --> 00:00:54.621
Can't you see that I'm still setting up?"

10
00:00:54.622 --> 00:00:56.798
"Sorry," Ben said.

11
00:00:56.799 --> 00:01:00.146
"I'm looking for Miss Bungle so I can sign up to volunteer.

12
00:01:00.147 --> 00:01:02.362
Do you know where she is?"

13
00:01:02.363 --> 00:01:04.975
"I think she's at the welcome booth over there."

14
00:01:04.976 --> 00:01:08.556
The fish monster pointed at a spot across the gym.

15
00:01:08.557 --> 00:01:11.479
"Thank you." Ben headed off.

16
00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:17.453
As he floated along, he saw a two-headed monster peering nervously at a piranha-keet.

17
00:01:17.454 --> 00:01:20.238
Maybe she'd never seen one before.

18
00:01:20.239 --> 00:01:25.887
Ben grinned. "She'll see lots more pets when the show officially opens," he thought.

19
00:01:25.888 --> 00:01:28.575
"So will Mayor Hubbletree when he comes to the show.

20
00:01:28.575 --> 00:01:30.930
That should be interesting!"

21
00:01:30.931 --> 00:01:36.395
Ben had always liked piranha-keets, but his family didn't have any pets.

22
00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:40.736
His mother was allergic to dogs, and cats didn't like ghosts.

23
00:01:40.737 --> 00:01:45.707
So she said it was best for their family to have no pets at all.

24
00:01:45.708 --> 00:01:48.745
But Ben was hoping that would change this weekend.

25
00:01:48.746 --> 00:01:55.392
Maybe at the Monster Academy pet show, he could finally find a pet that his mother would like.

26
00:01:55.393 --> 00:01:59.930
As he hurried past a training ring, he finally spotted Miss Bungle.

27
00:01:59.931 --> 00:02:04.434
She stood at the welcome booth, talking with Mayor Hubbletree and his wife.

28
00:02:04.435 --> 00:02:06.559
Ben greeted them.

29
00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:10.092
"I wanted to sign up to volunteer at the pet show, Miss Bungle.

30
00:02:10.093 --> 00:02:12.334
Do you still need volunteers?"

31
00:02:12.335 --> 00:02:18.133
"Yes, thank you, Ben!" Miss Bungle started gathering up some things for him.

32
00:02:18.134 --> 00:02:24.497
"That will be great. Here's a volunteer badge and a schedule of your duties."

33
00:02:24.498 --> 00:02:30.902
Ben took the bag from her. "Thanks. I think the pet show is going to be a lot of fun."

34
00:02:30.903 --> 00:02:33.445
"Me too," Miss Bungle said.

35
00:02:33.446 --> 00:02:42.647
But Mayor Hubbletree was rubbing his chin, looking worried as a monster went by with a vampire cat.

36
00:02:42.648 --> 00:02:47.313
"I hope these monster pets are well trained, Miss Bungle.

37
00:02:47.314 --> 00:02:51.407
Are you sure a monster pet show is a good idea?"

38
00:02:51.408 --> 00:02:55.650
"It's a wonderful idea, honey!" Mrs. Hubbletree patted his arm.

39
00:02:55.651 --> 00:02:59.358
"Monsters love animals just as much as people do.

40
00:02:59.359 --> 00:03:01.867
Besides, what could go wrong?"

41
00:03:01.868 --> 00:03:04.447
"Everything!" the mayor said.

42
00:03:04.448 --> 00:03:10.648
Ben could tell that he had more to say, but Mrs. Hubbletree shushed him with a finger on her lips.

43
00:03:10.649 --> 00:03:14.452
"Stop worrying," she said in a soothing voice.

44
00:03:14.453 --> 00:03:19.174
"It will be fine." She turned to Ben and changed the subject.

45
00:03:19.175 --> 00:03:24.254
"I love the pet shop in Monsterville that Mr. Freaky recommended to me.

46
00:03:24.255 --> 00:03:31.230
I got my rainbow gecko there." She held up a terrarium with a colorful gecko inside.

47
00:03:31.231 --> 00:03:37.289
"If I hadn't gotten Bowie, I wouldn't have gotten invited to this wonderful monster pet show.

48
00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:40.513
It's going to be such a fabulous weekend!"

49
00:03:40.514 --> 00:03:42.757
Ben peered into the terrarium.

50
00:03:42.758 --> 00:03:46.098
He could see the gecko hiding under a little bridge.

51
00:03:46.099 --> 00:03:49.409
"That's a cool-looking lizard, Mrs. Hubbletree."

52
00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:54.110
The mayor's wife beamed. "Rainbow geckos are very valuable.

53
00:03:54.111 --> 00:03:56.512
And they're smart," she added.

54
00:03:56.513 --> 00:04:04.242
"I registered Bowie for all three competitions at the show—tricks, obedience, and best pet."

55
00:04:04.243 --> 00:04:06.807
"Good luck," Ben said with a smile.

56
00:04:06.808 --> 00:04:14.657
He couldn't imagine how a gecko could compete in a trick or obedience contest, but he'd never been to a pet show before.

57
00:04:14.658 --> 00:04:17.471
"Maybe Bowie will win some prizes."

58
00:04:17.472 --> 00:04:21.042
She beamed again. "I hope so!"

59
00:04:21.043 --> 00:04:24.743
Just then Winnie spotted him and waved him over.

60
00:04:24.744 --> 00:04:30.610
"Hey, Ben!" She was holding her black kitten, Inky.

61
00:04:30.611 --> 00:04:33.208
"Hi, Winnie!" Ben smiled.

62
00:04:33.209 --> 00:04:37.007
"What are you doing here? The real show doesn't start until tomorrow."

63
00:04:37.008 --> 00:04:41.878
"Inky and I are checking out the gym so she's not scared tomorrow," Winnie said.

64
00:04:41.879 --> 00:04:46.523
"I've been training her—I think I'm going to enter her in the tricks competition."

65
00:04:46.524 --> 00:04:53.487
"Awesome!" Ben said. He tried to pet the kitten, but as usual, Inky hissed at him.

66
00:04:53.488 --> 00:04:58.053
Winnie giggled. "Inky still doesn't like you."

67
00:04:58.054 --> 00:05:02.766
Ben sighed. "Cats don't like ghosts, remember?"

68
00:05:02.767 --> 00:05:04.619
Winnie hugged Inky.

69
00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:07.605
"There will be lots of different kinds of pets at the show.

70
00:05:07.606 --> 00:05:11.713
Maybe you can find one for your family while you're here."

71
00:05:11.714 --> 00:05:14.646
"I was thinking the same thing," Ben said.

72
00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:18.857
"There's just one huge problem—my mom."

73
00:05:18.858 --> 00:05:22.439
"You mean because she's allergic to dogs?" Winnie asked.

74
00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:25.738
"Yeah, there's that problem," Ben replied.

75
00:05:25.739 --> 00:05:30.822
"But the fact is, she doesn't really like any pets."
